voice/CONSENT.md
# Your episodes go in episodes/<id>/ (copy the example there); the shipped example is examples/<id>/.
# Generated folders are local for both. The example's committed keyframes/ are reference frames, so only episodes/ ignores keyframes.
episodes/*/audio/
episodes/*/keyframes/
episodes/*/frames/
episodes/*/out/
examples/*/audio/
examples/*/frames/
examples/*/out/
out/
# No audio or video is ever committed (tools/safety/repo-check.js blocks the same list).
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.oga
*.opus
*.aac
*.wma
*.aif
*.aiff
*.mp4
*.m4v
